<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-8139] sanity test_101g: 'max_pages_per_rpc not correctly set'</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-8139</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for John Hammond &amp;lt;john.hammond@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/fb709a7a-18ec-11e6-b5f1-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/fb709a7a-18ec-11e6-b5f1-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_101g failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;max_pages_per_rpc not correctly set
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Maybe due to &lt;a href="http://review.whamcloud.com/19368" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;http://review.whamcloud.com/19368&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-7990" title=" Large bulk IO support" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-7990"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-7990&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and interaction with other patches.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Info required for matching: sanity 101g&lt;/p&gt;</description>
